      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "各位好，欢迎来到《国宝会说话》，我是老周。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act03",
      "name": "第 3 幕",
      "scene": "museum_hall",
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "今天不讲帝王将相，只讲三件文物，和它们背后的人间烟火。",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act04",
      "name": "第 4 幕",
      "scene": "display_case",
      "camera": "tilt_down",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "它们沉默千年，却在细节里，藏着最真实的中国。",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act05",
      "name": "第 5 幕",
      "scene": "museum_hall",
      "camera": "dolly",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "duration_hint": 8.0,
      "line": "",
      "text": "",
      "characters": [],
      "broll": true
    },
    {
      "id": "act06",
      "name": "第 6 幕",
      "scene": "display_case",
      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "第一件国宝，已经等了我们两千五百年。",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act07",
      "name": "第 7 幕",
      "scene": "excavation_site",
      "camera": "pan_left",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "一九七六年，湖北江陵，一座楚墓被打开。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act08",
      "name": "第 8 幕",
      "scene": "display_case",
      "camera": "rack_focus",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "墓中出土的这把剑，主人不是楚王，而是越王勾践。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act09",
      "name": "第 9 幕",
      "scene": "display_case",
      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "剑身满布菱形暗纹，出土时寒光四射，几乎没有锈蚀。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act10",
      "name": "第 10 幕",
      "scene": "archive_vault",
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "更惊人的是剑格上的八个鸟篆铭文：越王勾践，自作用剑。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act11",
      "name": "第 11 幕",
      "scene": "war_council",
      "camera": "crane_down",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "卧薪尝胆的君王，把屈辱和野心，都锻进了这把剑里。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act12",
      "name": "第 12 幕",
      "scene": "archive_vault",
      "camera": "dolly",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "青铜配比、硫化处理、同心圆剑首，每一项都是顶尖工艺。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act13",
      "name": "第 13 幕",
      "scene": "display_case",
      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "它像一句没说出口的话：忍耐，是为了有一天出鞘。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act14",
      "name": "第 14 幕",
      "scene": "display_case",
      "camera": "static",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "今天它静静躺在展柜里，锋芒仍在。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act15",
      "name": "第 15 幕",
      "scene": "palace_hall",
      "camera": "pan_left",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "duration_hint": 8.0,
      "line": "",
      "text": "",
      "characters": [],
      "broll": true
    },
    {
      "id": "act16",
      "name": "第 16 幕",
      "scene": "scroll_split",
      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "第二件国宝，是一幅画，也是一场十八岁少年的冒险。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act17",
