      "scene": "scholar_study",
      "camera": "tilt_up",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "北宋政和三年，王希孟用半年时间，画出了《千里江山图》。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act18",
      "name": "第 18 幕",
      "scene": "great_wall",
      "camera": "truck_left",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "十一米长卷，青绿设色，山峦叠翠，江河浩荡。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act19",
      "name": "第 19 幕",
      "scene": "river_fleet",
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "石青石绿来自矿物，千年不褪，至今仍亮得惊人。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act20",
      "name": "第 20 幕",
      "scene": "scroll_split",
      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_b",
      "text": "一个十八岁的年轻人，把一生只够画一次的山河，留给了我们。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_b"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act21",
      "name": "第 21 幕",
      "scene": "candle_gallery",
      "camera": "crane_up",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "画完不久，他便从历史中消失，只留下这卷江山。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act22",
      "name": "第 22 幕",
      "scene": "great_wall",
      "camera": "dolly_zoom",
      "camera_strength": 0.09,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "有人说，天才的代价，是把生命燃成一幅画。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act23",
      "name": "第 23 幕",
      "scene": "river_fleet",
      "camera": "static",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_b",
      "text": "也有人说，他把自己，画进了那片青山。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_b"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act24",
