      "camera": "crane_down",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "第三件，是一整套乐器：曾侯乙编钟。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act26",
      "name": "第 26 幕",
      "scene": "display_case",
      "camera": "dolly",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "六十五件青铜钟，总重两千五百多公斤，分三层悬挂。",
