      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "三件文物，一把剑、一幅画、一套钟。",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act35",
      "name": "第 35 幕",
      "scene": "museum_hall",
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "它们分别写着：忍耐、才华与秩序。",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act36",
      "name": "第 36 幕",
      "scene": "display_case",
      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "剑身上的菱形暗纹，是反复锻打留下的肌理。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act37",
      "name": "第 37 幕",
      "scene": "archive_vault",
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "camera_strength": 0.08,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "duration_hint": 6.5,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "这不仅是兵器，更是一份越国的国家档案。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
